gical determinants of the saving behavior of households. The data are collected through the CentERpanel, which collects data every week on various topics.<br>Not all Dutch people have computers with Internet access, nor do the panel members. Households without a computer and\/or Internet access are given the use of a simple computer and Internet access.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Business and Management","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"saving behavior"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"household"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"work"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"accommodation"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"mortgages"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"health"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"income"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"assets"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"liabilities"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"economic concepts"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"psychological concepts"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Internet"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"longitudinal study"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"ke